data-kid=\"27\">nhanh &amp; dễ dàng 🚌</span>\n    </h1>\n    <p class=\"hero-sub\" style=\"color:#9a7d6e; font-size:19px; margin:0 0 52px; font-weight:600;\" data-kid=\"28\">Hơn 200+ tuyến đường · Giá tốt nhất · Đặt ngay hôm nay 🎉</p>\n\n    \n    <div class=\"hero-search mx-auto rounded-3xl\" style=\"max-width:960px; background:#fff; padding:16px; box-shadow: 0 24px 80px rgba(232,93,4,0.13), 0 4px 24px rgba(74,59,50,0.07);\" data-kid=\"29\">\n      <div class=\"text-left px-4 pb-3\" style=\"font-family:'Quicksand',sans-serif; font-size:20px; font-weight:700; color:#4a3b32;\" data-kid=\"30\">\n        Đi đâu hôm nay? 🌟\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flex items-center rounded-2xl\" style=\"background:#fdfbf7;\" data-kid=\"31\">\n        \n        <div class=\"flex-1 px-5 py-4\" style=\"border-right:1.5px solid #f0e6d8;\" data-kid=\"32\">\n          <div class=\"text-xs font-700 uppercase mb-1.5\" style=\"color:#e85d04; letter-spacing:0.8px; font-weight:700;\" data-kid=\"33\">Điểm đi</div>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"34\">\n            <i class=\"ti ti-map-pin\" style=\"color:#e85d04; font-size:18px;\" data-kid=\"35\"></i>\n            <span class=\"font-700 text-base\" style=\"color:#4a3b32; font-weight:700;\" data-kid=\"36\">Hà Nội</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"px-3\" data-kid=\"37\">\n          <div class=\"w-9 h-9 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full cursor-pointer\" style=\"background:#fff0e6;\" data-kid=\"38\">\n            <i class=\"ti ti-arrows-right-left\" style=\"color:#e85d04; font-size:15px;\" data-kid=\"39\"></i>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"flex-1 px-5 py-4\" style=\"border-right:1.5px solid #f0e6d8;\" data-kid=\"40\">\n          <div class=\"text-xs font-700 uppercase mb-1.5\" style=\"color:#e85d04; letter-spacing:0.8px; font-weight:700;\" data-kid=\"41\">Điểm đến</div>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"42\">\n            <i class=\"ti ti-map-pin-filled\" style=\"color:#c4a898; font-size:18px;\" data-kid=\"43\"></i>\n            <span class=\"text-base font-500\" style=\"color:#c4a898;\" data-kid=\"44\">Chọn điểm đến</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"flex-1 px-5 py-4\" style=\"border-right:1.5px solid #f0e6d8;\" data-kid=\"45\">\n          <div class=\"text-xs font-700 uppercase mb-1.5\" style=\"color:#e85d04; letter-spacing:0.8px; font-weight:700;\" data-kid=\"46\">Ngày đi</div>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"47\">\n            <i class=\"ti ti-calendar\" style=\"color:#c4a898; font-size:18px;\" data-kid=\"48\"></i>\n            <span class=\"text-base font-600\" style=\"color:#4a3b32; font-weight:600;\" data-kid=\"49\">Hôm nay</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"flex-1 px-5 py-4\" data-kid=\"50\">\n          <div class=\"text-xs font-700 uppercase mb-1.5\" style=\"color:#e85d04; letter-spacing:0.8px; font-weight:700;\" data-kid=\"51\">Hành khách</div>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"52\">\n            <i class=\"ti ti-users\" style=\"color:#c4a898; font-size:18px;\" data-kid=\"53\"></i>\n            <span class=\"text-base font-600\" style=\"color:#4a3b32; font-weight:600;\" data-kid=\"54\">1 người</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"px-3\" data-kid=\"55\">\n          <button class=\"w-14 h-14 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full cursor-pointer border-0\" style=\"background:#e85d04; box-shadow:0 8px 28px rgba(232,93,4,0.45);\" data-kid=\"56\">\n            <i class=\"ti ti-search text-white\" style=\"font-size:22px;\" data-kid=\"57\"></i>\n          </button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    \n    <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3 justify-center mt-7 hero-chips\" data-kid=\"58\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-700 cursor-pointer rounded-full px-5 py-2.5\" style=\"background:#fff; border:1.5px solid #f0e6d8; color:#4a3b32; font-weight:700; box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(74,59,50,0.07);\" data-kid=\"59\">\n        <span data-kid=\"60\">Hà Nội → Đà Nẵng 🌊</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-700 cursor-pointer rounded-full px-5 py-2.5\" style=\"background:#fff; border:1.5px solid #f0e6d8; color:#4a3b32; font-weight:700; box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(74,59,50,0.07);\" data-kid=\"61\">\n        <span data-kid=\"62\">TP.HCM → Đà Lạt 🌿</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-700 cursor-pointer rounded-full px-5 py-2.5\" style=\"background:#fff; border:1.5px solid #f0e6d8; color:#4a3b32; font-weight:700; box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(74,59,50,0.07);\" data-kid=\"63\">\n        <span data-kid=\"64\">Huế → Hội An 🏮</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    \n    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-8 mt-10 flex-wrap hero-stats\" data-kid=\"65\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"66\">\n        <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center\" style=\"background:#fff0e6;\" data-kid=\"67\"><i class=\"ti ti-bus\" style=\"color:#e85d04; font-size:18px;\" data-kid=\"68\"></i></div>\n        <div class=\"text-left\" data-kid=\"69\">\n          <div class=\"text-lg font-700\" style=\"color:#4a3b32; font-family:'Quicksand',sans-serif; font-weight:700;\" data-kid=\"70\">200+</div>\n          <div class=\"text-xs\" style=\"color:#9a7d6e;\" data-kid=\"71\">Tuyến đường</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"w-px h-10\" style=\"background:#f0e6d8;\" data-kid=\"72\"></div>\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"73\">\n        <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center\" style=\"background:#e8f5ee;\" data-kid=\"74\"><i class=\"ti ti-users\" style=\"color:#2d6a4f; font-size:18px;\" data-kid=\"75\"></i></div>\n        <div class=\"text-left\" data-kid