 data-kid=\"187\"><em data-kid=\"188\">Hàng Đầu</em></h2>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-family:'Roboto Mono',monospace; font-size:11px; color:#999; letter-spacing:2px; max-width:240px; text-align:right; line-height:1.6;\" data-kid=\"189\">Nền tảng đặt vé xe khách số 1 tại Việt Nam</div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:20px;\" data-kid=\"190\">\n      \n      <div class=\"feat-card\" style=\"border:2px solid #000; padding:36px; box-shadow:4px 4px 0 #e85d04; transform:rotate(-1deg); background:#fff; cursor:default; min-height:220px;\" data-kid=\"191\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:flex-start; justify-content:space-between; margin-bottom:20px;\" data-kid=\"192\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:36px; color:#000; line-height:1;\" data-kid=\"193\"><i class=\"ti ti-shield-check\" data-kid=\"194\"></i></div>\n          <div style=\"font-family:'Roboto Mono',monospace; font-size:10px; letter-spacing:2px; color:#e85d04; border:1px solid #e85d04; padding:3px 8px;\" data-kid=\"195\">01</div>\n        </div>\n        <h3 style=\"font-family:'Playfair Display',serif; font-style:italic; font-size:26px; margin:0 0 14px 0; color:#000; line-height:1.2;\" data-kid=\"196\">An Toàn Tuyệt Đối</h3>\n        <p style=\"font-family:'Inter',sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.7; color:#444; margin:0;\" data-kid=\"197\">Tất cả nhà xe được kiểm định nghiêm ngặt. Theo dõi hành trình GPS theo thời gian thực 24/7.</p>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"feat-card\" style=\"border:2px solid #000; padding:36px; box-shadow:4px 4px 0 #e85d04; transform:rotate(1deg); background:#fff; cursor:default; min-height:220px;\" data-kid=\"198\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:flex-start; justify-content:space-between; margin-bottom:20px;\" data-kid=\"199\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:36px; color:#000; line-height:1;\" data-kid=\"200\"><i class=\"ti ti-clock-bolt\" data-kid=\"201\"></i></div>\n     